    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just hard to see it that way. it feels less like \"pain\" and more like reality. my family works so hard just to keep me going, to pay for everything, and in return i'm just... stuck. i'm just a drain on them. it feels selfish to stay like this.",
